"Artona III is one of the Triplanets, with gravity a little higher than Earth's."
"Its air is warm and damp with a faint smell of mildew, and its light is slightly off in color."
"A day there is a bit over twenty-six hours, counted in 54 not-quite-half-hour increments."
"Its winters are always mild, and Artonans drink hot drinks rather than chilled ones then."
"Artona III is the native world of the Ryeh-b't, a small flying reptile kept as a pet."
"The klerm, a noisy frog-like animal with a turtle-like shell, lives there."
"LeafSong University is on Artona III."
"Artona III has a House of Healing with pediatric healers, reached through a teleport alcove."
"Two-wheeled self-balancing carts carry people by verbal command."
"Silent mini-helicopters deliver takeout in high-tech tiffin-like containers."
"A natural history museum shaped like a concrete beehive hosts LeafSong's gala."
"A System call from Artona III to Earth costs 500 Argold plus 3 Argold a minute."
"Alden spent a twelve-day summons on Artona III working for LeafSong University."
